       },
       {
        "texto": "Good morning!",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Morning greeting.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Goddag!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Good morning! / Good day!",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Daytime greeting, a bit more formal than «hej».",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Godaften!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Good afternoon / Good evening!",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Evening greeting.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hej!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Hi! / Bye!",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Everyday and fine at any time.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Dav!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Hi!",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Informal; mostly used when greeting.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "The line between **godmorgen** and **goddag** doesn't depend on a fixed time; **hej** is the most versatile everyday option.",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "How are you?",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Danés",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hvordan har du det?**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "How are you?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "(Jeg har det) **fint / godt**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "I'm fine.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "(Jeg har det) **ikke så godt**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Not very good.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hvordan går det?**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "How's it going?",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "(Det går) **godt**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "It's going well.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "People usually answer briefly, for example **fint/godt** or **ikke så godt**. Depending on the situation, the conversation can go on or end there.",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Saying thanks",
     "columnas": [
