    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "And «please»?",
     "texto": [
      "There's no single equivalent for every context. For short, everyday requests you can add **tak** at the end:\n\n- **Ja tak** = Yes, please.\n- **Nej tak** = No, thanks.\n- **Nej tak, ellers tak** = No, but thanks anyway.\n\n**Venligst** («please») appears mostly in formal instructions and notices."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Saying goodbye",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Danés",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English and use",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
