       {
        "texto": "**Farvel!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Goodbye! General farewell.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hej! / Hej hej!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Hi! / Bye! Everyday, informal goodbyes.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Vi ses!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "See you! Everyday goodbye.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Godnat!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Good night! When saying goodbye at the end of the day or before going to bed.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hav det godt!**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Take care! Friendly goodbye.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "**Hils hjemme.**",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Regards to the people at home.",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "To end gracefully: **Nå, men jeg må videre** (Well, I have to get going) or **Nå, men jeg har faktisk travlt** (Well, I'm actually in a rush).",
